# TLS termination for the Phase 1 deployment (infrastructure/docs/phase-1-plan.md). Caddy
# automatically obtains and renews a Let's Encrypt certificate for this domain and handles the
# HTTP->HTTPS redirect — no manual cert/certbot steps. Requires DNS for the domain to actually
# resolve to this box, and port 80 reachable, before the first certificate can be issued (the
# ACME HTTP-01 challenge runs over plain HTTP).
workshop.mobmekauto.co.nz {
	reverse_proxy frontend:80
}
